{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1125.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"639db1311ac557e92161d30c802bd86e388ffe7504af7a5ceb7994c6ed547228","ja":"みなさん、こんにちは♪　今日は私たち3人が、\n『3000円ジャストショッピング！』に挑戦します！","zh":"大家好♪　今天由我们3个人，\n来挑战“3000日元刚好购！”！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1125.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"6ee379d6dc2fb8253d776a63617e007d81bc032f47231271162b795ba62ee0ac","ja":"今から1時間、値札を見ないで\nお買い物をしていきますね♪","zh":"接下来1小时内，不看价格标签\n尽情买东西吧♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1125.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"745f3991ad87545ad217052dcead0fb02fc1b08fc2d3c2872357f601cbb8d21e","ja":"3000円に一番近いお買い物ができた子が勝ちなノ！\nワタシたちが何を選ぶか、楽しみにしててネ♪","zh":"谁买的东西最接近3000日元，谁就获胜哦！\n敬请期待我们会选些什么吧♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1125.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"28f2029d63bf77fe57a285781b68b0adc3fd9405f2eeb3bd1f4ecedea5939c47","ja":"（ふふっ。こういう勝負って、\n活躍するチャンスよね。絶対に負けないわよ！）","zh":"（呵呵。这种比赛，\n正是大展身手的好机会呢。我绝对不会输的！）","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1125.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"76e8366f1a0e65ff962594acec9c049c4457d5f62d3d9f91204fdb0918b2f7f1","ja":"このネックレス、材質からして400円くらいね。\nさっき選んだワンピースとも相性がよさそうだわ！","zh":"这条项链从材质来看大概值400日元呢。\n跟刚才挑的那件连衣裙感觉也很搭！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1125.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"adbe1cd2dacbb911002d67efed9190baf129d1ccd0ae42b2fb1677eccba47444","ja":"あとは1000円くらいでもう1アイテム……\nあら？　麗花さん。","zh":"再买1000日元左右，就能再换1件道具……\n哎呀？是丽花小姐啊。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1125.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"ebc6a36aedf825fe442abc40eb451cdf8ff5aa7b3e931ac697f2af0323570fa3","ja":"あっ、律子さん。ここ、面白いお店いっぱいですね！\n素敵な商品が沢山あって、迷っちゃいます♪","zh":"啊，律子小姐。这里有好多有意思的店呢！\n棒极了的商品琳琅满目，都不知道该选哪个好了♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1125.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"9103a25e41dc605d8a07a828153176767e07a6a4aaf89307f3c64e08b44a81a5","ja":"ええ……って、それ登山用のウェアですか！？\nなんだか高そうですけど……？","zh":"欸……等等，那是登山用的衣服吗！？\n总觉得好像很贵的样子……？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1125.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"bc00c99493ae93e5000c252d7db0cd5597ab31471f511e78005bf6735e9382e6","ja":"いいなって思ったので、入れちゃいました♪\n他にいいのがあったら、取り替えようかなって。","zh":"觉得挺不错，就放进去了♪\n要是有其他好的，再换掉吧。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1125.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"c0632a8ed5a5f6ea82e9676e6eaf8c1cd30f7cd58468a6895d529db8476853fb","ja":"な、なるほど。\nまだ考え中ってところですか……。","zh":"原、原来如此。\n看来还在考虑当中啊……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1125.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"15823ea711f5b5718694ecc48bc518041055f251ff1d65ef40a93886e5594411","ja":"（麗花さんは勘が良さそうだし、値段ピッタリの商品を\n組み合わせてくるかも……油断はできないわね！）","zh":"（丽花小姐直觉很敏锐的样子，说不定能把商品组合得\n刚好符合价格……绝不能大意呢！）","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
